<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:composer="https://composer.betterlyrics.org/ttml" ttp:timeBase="media" xml:lang="ru" itunes:timing="Word" composer:timing="Word" composer:build="nn2ff62v">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>Прицел</ttm:title>
      <composer:meta key="artists" value="ТВОИ КОШМАРЫ"/>
      <composer:meta key="album" value="СМОТРЯЩИЕ"/>
      <composer:meta key="isrc" value="RUAGV2639900"/>
      <composer:meta key="Source" value="MusLyrics"/>
      <ttm:agent xml:id="v1" type="person">
        <ttm:name>Lead</ttm:name>
      </ttm:agent>
      <composer:groups>
        <composer:group id="g1" label="Group 1" color="#f472b6" templateVersion="1" sharesTiming="true"/>
        <composer:group id="g2" label="Group 2" color="#60a5fa" templateVersion="1" sharesTiming="true"/>
      </composer:groups>
      <iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal">
        <translations>
          <translation xml:lang="en" type="subtitle">
            <text for="L2">Advice in general is nonsense.</text>
            <text for="L3">I stepped on the rake and grabbed the wires.</text>
            <text for="L4">There is no point in drawing conclusions, and there is no time to draw them.</text>
            <text for="L5">Awareness and intelligence disappeared all at once.</text>
            <text for="L6">Mind is AWOL, mindfulness is useless</text>
            <text for="L7">There is none.</text>
            <text for="L8">My mood for the day is like a wolf:</text>
            <text for="L9">I howl at night, and during the day I look for money for crust.</text>
            <text for="L10">I work all day, then go to my box.</text>
            <text for="L11">Run away from here while you're still alive.</text>
            <text for="L12">While my eyes look into yours through the sight.</text>
            <text for="L13">After all, I decide who lives.</text>
            <text for="L14">And if I don't like you,</text>
            <text for="L15">I can strangle.</text>
            <text for="L16">I have no soul.</text>
            <text for="L17">I'm going to the dugouts,</text>
            <text for="L18">Mother nature, hold on.</text>
            <text for="L19">One wrong step</text>
            <text for="L20">floors were counted.</text>
            <text for="L21">I fell on knives.</text>
            <text for="L22">Do you hear, I fell on knives.</text>
            <text for="L23">Advice in general is nonsense.</text>
            <text for="L24">I stepped on the rake and grabbed the wires.</text>
            <text for="L25">There is no point in drawing conclusions, and there is no time to draw them.</text>
            <text for="L26">Awareness and intelligence disappeared all at once.</text>
            <text for="L27">Mind is AWOL, mindfulness is useless</text>
            <text for="L28">There is none.</text>
            <text for="L29">My mood for the day is like a wolf:</text>
            <text for="L30">I howl at night, and during the day I look for money for crust.</text>
            <text for="L31">I work all day, then go to my box.</text>
          </translation>
        </translations>
